    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 2805,
    "lineEnd": 2808
  },
  "section": "3.81",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Druid Traits table: Hit Point Die and training with Light armor and Shields.  \n- Gain the Druid's level 1 features, which are listed in the Druid Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
